 applications=["'Faithful to Scripture, caring for the world'—does your faith hold both truth and social responsibility?","Living simply and humbly despite high standing—has status changed how you treat people?","Build people up with rigorous exegesis, not preaching by feeling","Beyond evangelism, do one act of care for a social need today"],
